      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Payment to onboarding\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nWhen a customer pays an invoice, the payment webhook is verified by signature before anything else happens. Only a genuine paid-invoice event goes further.\n\nThe invoice and customer are updated, purchased service lines are marked paid, and the team hears about it first.\n\nA thank-you email is drafted and approved in Slack, then sent, and onboarding starts. Unmatched payments raise an alert.",
